return {h=10,w=350,cr=45,hc=20,bh=70,gr="medium",eg={"plant"},st={65,55,115,100,40,60},ab={{34,0},{102,0},{144,1}},genus={en="Vine Pokémon",es="Pokémon Enredadera",pt="Pokémon Vinha"},flavor={en={[1]="The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. Its vines shake as it walks.",[2]="The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. Its vines shake as it walks.",[3]="Its identity is obscured by masses of thick, blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing.",[4]="The vines that cloak its entire body are always jiggling. They effectively unnerve its foes.",[5]="It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.",[6]="During battle, it constantly moves the vines that cover its body in order to annoy its opponent.",[7]="TANGELA’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",[8]="TANGELA’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",[9]="Its vines snap off easily and painlessly if they are grabbed, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by new growth the very next day.",[10]="Blue plant vines cloak the Pokémon’s identity in a tangled mass. It entangles anything that gets close.",[11]="The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. The vines sway as it walks.",[12]="It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines.",[13]="It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines.",[14]="The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.",[15]="The vines that cloak its entire body are always jiggling. They effectively unnerve its foes.",[16]="It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.",[17]="The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.",[18]="The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.",[21]="Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.",[22]="Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.",[23]="Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.",[24]="It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.",[25]="Tangela’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",[26]="Tangela’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.",[31]="Its identity is obscured by masses of thick blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing.",[32]="Its identity is obscured by masses of thick blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing.",[33]="Hidden beneath a tangle of vines that grows nonstop even if the vines are torn off, this Pokémon’s true appearance remains a mystery.",[34]="The vines of a Tangela have a distinct scent. In some parts of Galar, Tangela vines are used as herbs.",[39]="It is cloaked entirely in blue vines, preventing any glimpse of its true identity. The vines impart a refreshing sensation when chewed, they're useful as a spice."},es={[23]="Se camufla con la multitud de lianas que envuelven su cuerpo y que no dejan de crecer a lo largo de toda su vida.",[24]="Enreda cualquier cosa que se mueva con sus lianas. Si te atrapa, te hará cosquillas con su delicado balanceo.",[25]="A Tangela se le desprenden los tentáculos con facilidad en cuanto se los agarras. Y no solo no le duele, sino que le resulta muy útil para escapar rápido. Además, al día siguiente le crecen otros.",[26]="A Tangela se le desprenden los tentáculos con facilidad en cuanto se los agarras. Y no solo no le duele, sino que le resulta muy útil para escapar rápido. Además, al día siguiente le crecen otros.",[31]="Se camufla tras una gran masa de lianas azules. Se dice que nunca dejan de crecer.",[32]="Se camufla tras una gran masa de lianas azules. Se dice que nunca dejan de crecer.",[33]="Sus lianas no dejan de crecer aunque se le desprendan. Aún se desconoce qué aspecto tiene sin ellas.",[34]="Sus lianas despiden una fragancia peculiar. En cierta zona de Galar se usan como aderezo."},pt="Fica totalmente coberto por vinhas azuis, que impedem qualquer vislumbre de sua verdadeira aparência. As vinhas dão uma sensação refrescante quando mastigadas e são úteis como tempero."},evo={{s=114},{s=465,from=114,c={{t="level-up",move=246}}}},moves={[1]={1,132,1,20,29,71,32,77,36,78,39,79,45,21,49,74},[2]={1,132,24,20,27,71,29,22,32,77,36,78,39,79,45,21,48,74},[3]={1,132,4,79,10,71,13,77,19,22,25,20,31,72,34,78,40,21,46,74},[4]={1,132,4,79,10,71,13,77,19,22,25,20,31,72,34,78,40,21,46,74},[5]={1,275,1,132,4,79,10,71,13,74,19,77,22,22,28,20,31,72,37,78,40,21,46,321},[6]={1,275,1,132,4,79,10,71,13,74,19,77,22,22,28,20,31,72,37,78,40,21,46,321},[7]={1,275,1,132,4,79,10,71,13,74,19,77,22,22,28,20,31,72,37,78,40,21,46,321},[8]={1,275,1,132,5,79,8,71,12,74,15,77,19,22,22,20,26,72,29,78,33,246,36,282,40,363,43,21,47,321,50,378,54,438},[9]={1,275,1,132,5,79,8,71,12,74,15,77,19,22,22,20,26,72,29,78,33,246,36,282,40,363,43,21,47,321,50,378,54,438},[10]={1,275,1,132,5,79,8,71,12,74,15,77,19,22,22,20,26,72,29,78,33,246,36,282,40,363,43,21,47,321,50,378,54,438},[11]={1,275,1,132,5,79,8,71,12,74,15,77,19,22,22,20,26,72,29,78,33,282,36,246,40,363,43,21,47,321,50,378,54,438},[12]=